WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:09,660
Little bastard, what are you doing Zhang Jianguo?

2
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,700
This is our Lao Li family's housework

3
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:13,620
Why do you, an outsider, care?

4
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:15,020
I'll take care of it today

5
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:21,500
You just watch him Zhang Jianguo

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,820
A person from Houhai Village

7
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,700
He is domineering in our Lijiazhuang

8
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,540
Lawless and bullying?

9
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,780
How could Zhang Jianguo be hitting me?

10
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:30,820
He is slapping our entire Lijiazhuang in the face.

11
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:34,680
Li Qingyun, stop talking nonsense here.

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,560
Is it wrong to be afraid that Zhang Jianguo will beat someone?

13
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,920
But look, what you two brothers and your mother are doing are personnel affairs?

14
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:40,200
The first line of family ties and morality

15
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:41,160
Which one did you take?

16
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:42,560
Yes, you are here

17
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:45,160
It's totally embarrassing our entire Lijia Village. How can I beat you to death?

18
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:47,040
The bastard still wants to use this swordsmanship to force us to help you.

19
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,320
Go and have your mother’s spring and autumn dreams

20
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,800
If we really helped you

21
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,560
That would be a disgrace to the entire Lijia Village.

22
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,360
Spread the word to our entire village

23
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:54,480
It makes everyone look down on them
